Calibration aware neural pre-decoding for the surface code on one Alveo U55C
Copyright 2026 Nasir Ali, C-DAC Noida

This repository contains:

- data/calibration/*.csv: device calibration values exported (calib/ibm_csv.py) from the calibration snapshots that
  ship with qiskit-ibm-runtime 0.50.0 (qiskit_ibm_runtime/fake_provider/backends/*/props_*.json), Apache License 2.0,
  Copyright 2021 IBM and its contributors. Values are unchanged; only the file format differs.
- model/qmodel.py, host/, hls/, build/: the integer model, host runtime and HLS kernel of the earlier work
  github.com/nasir26/u55c-neural-predecoder-nodes (same author), reused unchanged.

This repository uses, but does not contain:

- NVIDIA Ising-Decoding (https://github.com/NVIDIA/Ising-Decoding), Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA
  CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. scripts/setup_reference.sh clones it at commit 33acb152e403bc189f2effdb07f1a87b34c745f1;
  calib/noise.py and harness/pipeline.py call it unchanged.
- The pretrained weights nvidia/Ising-Decoder-SurfaceCode-1-Fast on Hugging Face, distributed by NVIDIA under the
  NVIDIA Open Model License and gated behind its acceptance. They are not redistributed here; scripts/fetch_weights.sh
  downloads them for a user who has accepted that licence.
- The bitstream build/hw/predecoder.xclbin, published as a release asset of the earlier work and fetched by
  scripts/fetch_bitstreams.sh with its SHA256.
